  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "It is dark under the tree, so Tom takes a flashlight. Maya takes the radio and some yellow cheese. They go to the big tree in the garden. Tom shines the flashlight under the roots. A little mouse comes out of a hole. “Hello, little mouse!” says Maya. “We have some cheese for you. Will you give us the key?” The mouse gives them a silver key, takes the cheese and points its paw at a pile of leaves. The children brush the leaves aside – between the roots of the tree there is a small, old door!",
      "start_ms": 7652,
      "end_ms": 47132
    },
